WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.754
We lost Jericho
when he was 13 weeks.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:04.963
Dorothy took it hard.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.467
She'll come back
in her own time.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.886
What if she never comes back?

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.845
 

